From 4f735e5dff899bd87e029f1749532880152482b3 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Claude <noreply@anthropic.com>
Date: Sun, 30 Aug 2026 21:40:41 +0000
Subject: [PATCH] Add play/pause and mute controls to gallery videos
MIME-Version: 1.0
Content-Type: text/plain; charset=UTF-8
Content-Transfer-Encoding: 8bit

Gallery videos autoplayed silently in a loop with no way to stop or
unmute them. Adds a minimal glass-chrome overlay (play/pause, mute)
to the gallery lightbox and the standalone videoLoop media block, in
it/en/zh. Hero backgrounds and project-card cover loops keep their
original silent, uncontrolled behavior — they're decorative, not
content being viewed.
